,"status":"context-only"},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-loop#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~22","parent":"py3-source/python3-loop","order":33,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Python3 循环语句","实例"],"titleOccurrence":22,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-loop.html","sourceSha256":"28fdbd05a38d524cdb54c772aa757e6178befac90295d53f38f3a8f82673f1bb","articleSourceOrder":19,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.382b4bdf5cd360044124e0a0","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","status":"context-only"},{"sourceNodeId":"py3-source/python3-loop#%E5%AE%9E%E4%BE%8B~23","parent":"py3-source/python3-loop","order":34,"tag":"h2","titleOriginal":"实例","titleDisplay":"实例","titlePath":["Python3 循环语句","实例"],"titleOccurrence":23,"role":"example-caption","anchor":null,"sourceRef":"https://www.runoob.com/python3/python3-loop.html","sourceSha256":"28fdbd05a38d524cdb54c772aa757e6178befac90295d53f38f3a8f82673f1bb","articleSourceOrder":19,"platformRef":{"id":"py3.section.dae7a891238de77ebee99097","version":"1.0.0"},"profile":"mixed-core","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","status":"context-only"}],"examples":[{"id":"py3.section.c19894c1a2f90f3b33796e95.example","lessonId":"py3.section.c19894c1a2f90f3b33796e95","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"遇到无效记录要跳过它并继续读后续记录，用哪个？","result":"用 continue。"},{"id":"py3.section.9fb4d58c6dfe4e620900848f.example","lessonId":"py3.section.9fb4d58c6dfe4e620900848f","status":"runnable-required","reason":"原创完整程序，使用同一受限 Rust/WASM 实际运行","source":"limit = int(input())\ncurrent = 2\ntotal = 0\nwhile current <= limit:\n    total += current\n    # 跳到下一个偶数，使循环推进。\n    current += 2\nprint(total)","sourceSha256":"ee5b8ce1d040b39879d21b86b9bf655e48cca3dabd361dfeed4ba017cb2bcb27","cases":[{"name":"包含偶数上界","input":"6\n","stdout":"12\n"},{"name":"上界为奇数","input":"5\n","stdout":"6\n"},{"name":"空区间","input":"-1\n","stdout":"0\n"}]},{"id":"py3.section.26c4507a1efecf2637d9001d.example","lessonId":"py3.section.26c4507a1efecf2637d9001d","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"while n>0 内未修改 n，初值 1 会怎样？","result":"条件一直为真，最终触发平台资源限制。"},{"id":"py3.section.a9d9669f49dda38720cfb69f.example","lessonId":"py3.section.a9d9669f49dda38720cfb69f","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"初始条件就为假且没有 break，else 会执行吗？","result":"会。循环自然结束，尽管主体没有执行。"},{"id":"py3.section.294eff930f93a25b1af5f16a.example","lessonId":"py3.section.294eff930f93a25b1af5f16a","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"一行 while 语句在本平台被拒绝，怎样保持含义？","result":"把主体另起一行缩进，并确保推进或退出逻辑仍在主体内。"},{"id":"py3.section.daf3cf1e3fa6c217865e4223.example","lessonId":"py3.section.daf3cf1e3fa6c217865e4223","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"for i in range(3) 的最后一个 i 是多少？","result":"2。range 的终点 3 不包含。"},{"id":"py3.section.27f2fd051a52d6db68e741ac.example","lessonId":"py3.section.27f2fd051a52d6db68e741ac","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"用 break 在循环中找到目标，else 是否还会报告没找到？","result":"不会。break 跳过该 else。"},{"id":"py3.section.1a62f259242fa758af26b057.example","lessonId":"py3.section.1a62f259242fa758af26b057","status":"runnable-required","reason":"原创完整程序，使用同一受限 Rust/WASM 实际运行","source":"start = int(input())\nstop = int(input())\nstride = int(input())\n# 让 range 直接决定循环变量的取值。\nfor value in range(start, stop, stride):\n    print(value)","sourceSha256":"752e99782a42403ff5f19f43072dfb65f6dfa24bfa959ca49b9bfe755d3f7c88","cases":[{"name":"向下步进并排除终点","input":"8\n-1\n-3\n","stdout":"8\n5\n2\n"},{"name":"向上步进","input":"1\n7\n2\n","stdout":"1\n3\n5\n"},{"name":"方向与区间不匹配","input":"8\n2\n1\n","stdout":""},{"name":"零步长","input":"1\n5\n0\n","stdout":"","diagnostic":"E_PY_VALUE"}]},{"id":"py3.section.126798a3961136c0a4312617.example","lessonId":"py3.section.126798a3961136c0a4312617","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"在计数器更新前 continue，下一轮能看到本轮更新后的计数吗？","result":"不能，更新语句没有执行，可能导致条件一直不变。"},{"id":"py3.section.2c522babeff24b2390377e73.example","lessonId":"py3.section.2c522babeff24b2390377e73","status":"reading-only","reason":"本页同时讲解受限子集与完整 Python；只有映射中逐项标出的原创例子和练习获得本期运行承诺。","prompt":"if 满足后执行 pass，if 后的外层语句还会执行吗？","result":"会，随后正常继续。"}],"activities":[{"id":"py3.section.c19894c1a2f90f3b33796e95.check","lessonId":"py3.section.c19894c1a2f90f3b33796e95","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.c19894c1a2f90f3b33796e95.example","prompt":"遇到无效记录要跳过它并继续读后续记录，用哪个？","reveal":"用 continue。"},{"id":"py3.practice.while-odd-sum","lessonId":"py3.section.9fb4d58c6dfe4e620900848f","kind":"rust-judge","profileRef":{"id":"py3.practice.while-odd-sum","version":"1.0.0"},"title":"用 while 累加上界以内的奇数","task":"读取 n。用 while 累加 1 到 n 中的正奇数；n 小于 1 时输出 0。","observation":"真实 while 条件和累加绑定更新，空区间只检查一次条件","hints":["奇数序列从 1 开始，每次增加 2。让累加器起始为 0。","条件应允许候选值等于上界。测试 1、2 和负数，分别检查只有一项、越过上界和空区间的行为。"],"caseCount":4},{"id":"py3.section.26c4507a1efecf2637d9001d.check","lessonId":"py3.section.26c4507a1efecf2637d9001d","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.26c4507a1efecf2637d9001d.example","prompt":"while n>0 内未修改 n，初值 1 会怎样？","reveal":"条件一直为真，最终触发平台资源限制。"},{"id":"py3.section.a9d9669f49dda38720cfb69f.check","lessonId":"py3.section.a9d9669f49dda38720cfb69f","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.a9d9669f49dda38720cfb69f.example","prompt":"初始条件就为假且没有 break，else 会执行吗？","reveal":"会。循环自然结束，尽管主体没有执行。"},{"id":"py3.section.294eff930f93a25b1af5f16a.check","lessonId":"py3.section.294eff930f93a25b1af5f16a","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.294eff930f93a25b1af5f16a.example","prompt":"一行 while 语句在本平台被拒绝，怎样保持含义？","reveal":"把主体另起一行缩进，并确保推进或退出逻辑仍在主体内。"},{"id":"py3.section.daf3cf1e3fa6c217865e4223.check","lessonId":"py3.section.daf3cf1e3fa6c217865e4223","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.daf3cf1e3fa6c217865e4223.example","prompt":"for i in range(3) 的最后一个 i 是多少？","reveal":"2。range 的终点 3 不包含。"},{"id":"py3.section.27f2fd051a52d6db68e741ac.check","lessonId":"py3.section.27f2fd051a52d6db68e741ac","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.27f2fd051a52d6db68e741ac.example","prompt":"用 break 在循环中找到目标，else 是否还会报告没找到？","reveal":"不会。break 跳过该 else。"},{"id":"py3.practice.range-sum","lessonId":"py3.section.1a62f259242fa758af26b057","kind":"rust-judge","profileRef":{"id":"py3.practice.range-sum","version":"1.0.0"},"title":"对任意方向的 range 求和","task":"逐行读取 start、stop 和非零 step。通过 for 与三参数 range 累加区间值并输出总和。","observation":"实际 range 游标每步推进，边界排除 stop，空区间无循环体更新","hints":["把三次输入的结果原顺序交给 range，循环变量就是本轮要累加的值。","初始化总和后再循环，只在循环体累加，最后输出一次。用负步长和空区间各检查一次。"],"caseCount":4},{"id":"py3.section.126798a3961136c0a4312617.check","lessonId":"py3.section.126798a3961136c0a4312617","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.126798a3961136c0a4312617.example","prompt":"在计数器更新前 continue，下一轮能看到本轮更新后的计数吗？","reveal":"不能，更新语句没有执行，可能导致条件一直不变。"},{"id":"py3.section.2c522babeff24b2390377e73.check","lessonId":"py3.section.2c522babeff24b2390377e73","kind":"optional-self-check","exampleId":"py3.section.2c522babeff24b2390377e73.example","prompt":"if 满足后执行 pass，if 后的外层语句还会执行吗？","reveal":"会，随后正常继续。"}],"references":[],"diagrams":[{"title":"循环中的控制转移","steps":["判断下一轮是否进入","执行循环体","continue 回到检查，break 跳到循环后"],"origin":"platform-original"}]}
